      <activity id="32279762-421e-5841-8bdb-94137af8297f" activityNameId="2787c0ad-b625-5bd7-911c-511113c0543b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat distribution system, air heating, specific heat demand 10W</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat distribution system, air heating, specific heat demand 10W
Production of components for the heat distribution of an air-heating system;
UUID: 52a6ec5f-77d1-35d3-b456-9920d15950d1
Materials used for the production. Energy use for the production and processing of the raw materials. No infrastructure of the production site and no transports of raw materials included.
Location: Data sources from three buildings in Switzerland. Process applicable in central European conditions.
Technology: Typical technology, materials and components used for an heat distribution system with air in low energy apartment buildings; only additional components for heating included; ducts and air handling unit of ventilation system not included.
Time period: Amount of material for average investigated in 2008. Process information partly from 2004
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data from one specific building from literature and assumptions 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_52a6ec5f-77d1-35d3-b456-9920d15950d1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
